{"id":"n49419-2-7","stage":0,"title":"사다 · 雇","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49419-2-7-1","ko":"일이 금방 안 끝나겠는데?","zh":"工作好像不会很快结束吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"2","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일이","audio":"/audio/deca3bc3889d43a361ec.mp3"}},{"text":"금방","meaning":"马上，立刻，立马","explanation":"금방：马上，立刻，立马","readings":[{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34764","senseId":"3","lemma":"금방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"끝나겠는데?","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝나다：结束，完成；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝나겠는데","audio":"/audio/9662094c4fe99486e7c8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带着某种计划和意图想要实现的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"08c341712591f51e","term":"금방","zh":"马上，立刻，立马","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3","entryId":"34764","definition":"时间过去不久，很快。","pronunciation":["금방"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"事情做完。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/42998ad20cce1ce90978.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49419-2-7-2","ko":"일꾼이라도 사서 오늘 중으로 꼭 마쳐야 해.","zh":"就算雇个人来，今天之内也必须完成。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"일꾼이라도","meaning":"雇工","explanation":"일꾼：雇工；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"일꾼","audio":"/audio/5da8657419af3f6d7040.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72211","senseId":"1","lemma":"일꾼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일꾼이라도","audio":"/audio/ce75320bd9098f090e2c.mp3"}},{"text":"사서","meaning":"雇，雇佣","explanation":"사다：雇，雇佣；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"2","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사서","audio":"/audio/79e1762272bf6ddd5568.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"중으로","meaning":"里，内","explanation":"중：里，内；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"중","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79404","senseId":"4","lemma":"중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중으로","audio":"/audio/8ca1a7a3f62b554cb6ea.mp3"}},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"一定，必定","explanation":"꼭：一定，必定","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}},{"text":"마쳐야","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"마치다：结束，完成；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"마치다","audio":"/au